  (text "IMPLEMENTED: MCU support, USB data, 3.3 V buck, 3 H-bridges, 3 Hall sensors, ADS7038.\nOPEN: CC detection + input protection + haptic supply switch / hardware timeout.\nOPEN: PAW3950/optics, IMU, MA735/DRV8316 wheel, RGB and final GPIO assignment.\nVBUS_USB is intentionally NOT connected to PWR_5V_PENDING or ACT_5V_PENDING.\nThis draft will not operate from its USB connector until power design is completed."
    (at 25 180 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "326f7c0d-a7a5-59c3-9eba-3ad84bff635f"))
  (text "JLCPCB: inspect MPN, LCSC and Sourcing Status fields in Symbol Properties.\nBlank sourcing fields and unassigned footprints are tracked in SOURCING.md.\nNo board layout, Gerbers or component-placement file exists yet.\nGlobal net labels connect across these sheets. Unused MCU pins are NC only for this draft."
    (at 25 225 0)
